Comment: 0,0:00:14.77,0:00:20.18,translation **,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Yeaaah! Don’t you let go of my hand—let's become one!
Comment: 0,0:00:20.62,0:00:26.05,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Aaaah! I'll take you to a totally  unpredictable tomorrow!
Comment: 0,0:00:25.85,0:00:26.55,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Let's go!
Comment: 0,0:00:32.32,0:00:38.02,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}The sky we look up to—it’s so small, and turning into chaos
Comment: 0,0:00:38.19,0:00:43.32,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Enlighten me, Joseph, I'm like a cat in a box
Comment: 0,0:00:44.34,0:00:50.89,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}The universe is so vast and so cold, my delusions are freezing
